      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Hyperpneumatization of the craniocervical bones is a very rare disorder and there are only assumptions as to the cause of this potentially dangerous condition. This article reports the case of a 44-year-old patient with severe pneumatization who became symptomatic after a minor skiing accident without any direct trauma."},
